flowchart LR
    tech[Technicians<br/>Germany + France<br/>~400 managed users] -->|Corporate network; HTTPS 443; Kerberos SPNEGO| dns[Private corporate DNS]
    dc[(On-prem Active Directory<br/>DNS / KDC)] <-->|Private WAN / VPN or ExpressRoute| hub[Azure private network]
    wms[Wuppertal WMS] -->|Hourly stock file; SFTP 22<br/>private WAN| hub
    dns --> hub

    subgraph DE[PRD primary - Germany West Central / EU]
        appLB[Internal application LB<br/>private SPX FQDN]
        sftpLB[Internal SFTP LB<br/>private SPX SFTP FQDN]
        subgraph AZ1[Availability zone 1]
            app1[RHEL 9 VM<br/>Java 17 Spring Boot<br/>Kerberos keytab]
            sftp1[SPX SFTP ingress VM]
        end
        subgraph AZ2[Availability zone 2]
            app2[RHEL 9 VM<br/>Java 17 Spring Boot<br/>Kerberos keytab]
            sftp2[SPX SFTP ingress VM]
        end
        landing[(EU Blob stock landing<br/>durable / replayable)]
        db[(Private PostgreSQL Flexible Server<br/>zone-redundant HA; ~50 GB)]
        vault[EU Key Vault<br/>keys / API secrets]
        backup[EU Backup vault<br/>monthly points >=6 months]
        obs[EU monitoring<br/>logs / metrics / alerts]
        egress[Controlled HTTPS egress]
        appLB --> app1 & app2
        sftpLB --> sftp1 & sftp2
        sftp1 & sftp2 -->|Validated completed file| landing
        landing -->|Idempotent hourly import| app1 & app2
        app1 & app2 --> db
        app1 & app2 --> vault
        app1 & app2 --> obs
        db --> backup
        app1 & app2 --> egress
    end

    hub --> appLB
    hub --> sftpLB
    app1 & app2 <-->|SPNEGO service ticket validation| dc
    egress -->|Shipment create; HTTPS 443| dhl[DHL shipping API<br/>external processing / residency review]

    subgraph FR[Proposed DR - France Central / EU]
        drapp[Preprovisioned app + SFTP tier<br/>private endpoints; controlled cutover]
        drdb[(Warm PostgreSQL read replica<br/>asynchronous; lag monitored)]
        drbackup[EU recovery access / backup plan]
        drapp --> drdb
        drbackup -. restore alternative .-> drdb
    end
    db -->|Async replication; RPO not guaranteed| drdb
    backup -. recovery points .-> drbackup
    hub -. DR private route / AD reachability .-> drapp
    dns -. Manual DNS switch after fencing + promotion .-> drapp
